            "description": "运行中实时状态（run_tasks 写入的 dev_assets/private/live-status/current.json，宿主读取后转发，另加 age_s = 文件距今秒数）：version / run_id / state（starting/running/stopping/finished）/ outcome / outcome_text / started_at / updated_at / elapsed_s / tasks[{name,label,state,text}] / current / step（一句中文）/ progress / clicks{used,cap} / last_frame_at / wing（season / weeks_left / stats / sp / fans / fans_left / stamina / decision / events / live）。只供显示，不含路径、截图或节点名；≤ 48 KiB。"
          },
